---
pagination:
  data: homeworks
  size: 1
  alias: hw
permalink: "homework_{{ hw.numberStr }}.html"
layout: base.njk
tags: homework
eleventyComputed:
  title: "Homework {{ hw.numberStr }} (5 pts.)"
icon: fa-book
navigation:
  - name: "Home"
    link: "index.html"
    icon: "fa-gavel"
---

{% set assignment_name = hw.assignmentName %}
{% set assignment_display = hw.assignmentDisplay %}
{% set assignment_resource = resources | findAssignmentResource(assignment_display, '') %}
{% set document_link = '' %}
{% if assignment_resource %}
    {% set document_link = assignment_resource.link %}
{% endif %}
{% set document_preview_link = document_link | replace('/copy', '/preview') %}

<h2>Task 1: Notebook</h2>

<p>Copy the following notebook and answer the included questions using the method of your choosing:</p>

{% if document_link %}
<div class="alert alert-success">
<a href="{{ document_link }}">OPEN DOCUMENT IN GOOGLE DOCS</a>
</div>
{% endif %}

<p>For your convenience the document is displayed below but you will likely
find it easier to copy the document from the google drive link above.</p>

{% if document_link %}
<div class="embed-responsive embed-responsive-4by3">
<iframe class="embed-responsive-item course-embed" width="100%" height="800" src="{{ document_preview_link }}"></iframe>
</div>
{% else %}
<div class="alert alert-warning">
<p>Document link not yet available. Please check back later.</p>
</div>
{% endif %}

<pre style="display: none;" id="dr-container" class="codehilite"><code id="dredd-response"></code></pre>

<h2>Task 2: Assignment Submission Instructions</h2>

<p>Upload the document to canvas for the assignment as a PDF.</p>
